### Conclusion and Recommendations

The supply chain resilience and vendor management initiative represents a strategic priority for Manus Orion Group with significant revenue and market share implications. Successful execution requires continued executive sponsorship from Sarah Chen, disciplined program management, and cross-functional collaboration.

